{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-hos-11-1","title":"Hosea 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The ingratitude of Israel unto God for his benefits. 5 His judgment. 8 God's mercy toward them. 12 Israel's falsehood and Judah's fidelity.</p>\n<p>Israel. 2:15; De 7:7; Jer 2:2; Eze 16:6; Mal 1:2 called. Ex 4:22; Mt 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-2","title":"Hosea 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>they called. 7; De 29:2-4; 1Sa 8:7-9; 2Ki 17:13-15; 2Ch 36:15,16; Ne 9:30 Isa 30:9-11; Jer 35:13; 44:16,17; Zec 1:4; 7:11; Lu 13:34; Joh 3:19 Ac 7:51; 2Co 2:15,16 they sacrificed. 2:13; 13:1,2; Jud 2:13; 3:7; 10:6; 1Ki 16:31,32; 18:19; 2Ki 17:16 burned. 1Ki 12:33; Isa 65:7; Jer 18:15; 44:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-3","title":"Hosea 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>taught. Ex 19:4; Nu 11:11,12; De 1:31; 8:2; 32:10-12; Isa 46:3; 63:9 Ac 13:18 I healed. 2:8; 7:1; 14:4; Ex 15:26; 23:25; Isa 1:2; 30:26; Jer 8:22; 30:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-4","title":"Hosea 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>drew. So 1:4; Isa 63:9; Joh 6:44; 12:32; 2Co 5:14 of a. 2Sa 7:14 I was. Le 26:13 take off. Heb. lift up. and I laid. 2:8; Ps 78:23-25; 105:40; Joh 6:32-58</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-5","title":"Hosea 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>shall not. 7:16; 8:13; 9:3,6 but. 5:13; 10:6; 2Ki 15:19,29; 17:3-6; 18:11; Isa 8:6-8; Am 5:27 \"They became tributaries to Salmanasser.\"</p>\n<p>because. 6:1; 2Ki 17:13,14; 18:12; Jer 8:4-6; Am 4:6,8-10; Zec 1:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-6","title":"Hosea 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the sword. 10:14; 13:16; Le 26:31,33; De 28:52; 32:25; Jer 5:17; Mic 5:11 consume. Ps 80:11-16; Isa 9:14; 18:5; 27:10; Eze 15:2-7; 20:47; Mal 4:1 because. 10:6; Ps 106:39,43; Isa 30:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-7","title":"Hosea 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>are bent. 4:16; 14:4; Ps 78:57,58; Pr 14:14; Jer 3:6,8,11; 8:5; 14:7 they called me. 2; 7:16; 2Ch 30:1-11; Ps 81:11; Am 5:4-6,14,15 none at all would exalt him. Heb. together they exalted not.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-8","title":"Hosea 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>How shall I give. 6:4; Jer 9:7; La 3:33; Mt 23:37; Lu 19:41,42 Admah. Ge 14:8; 19:24,25; De 29:23; Isa 1:9,10; Am 4:11; Zep 2:9; 2Pe 2:6 Jude 1:7; Re 11:8; 18:18 Mine. De 32:36; Jud 10:16; 2Sa 24:16; 2Ki 13:23; Ps 106:45; Isa 63:15 Jer 3:12; 31:20; Am 7:3,6 heart. La 1:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-9","title":"Hosea 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>not execute. 14:4; Ex 32:10-14; De 32:26,27; Ps 78:38; Isa 27:4-8; 48:9 Jer 30:11; 31:1-3; Eze 20:8,9,13,14,21-23 return. 1Sa 26:8; 2Sa 20:10 for. Nu 23:19; Isa 55:8,9; Mic 7:18-20; Mal 3:6; Ro 11:28,29 the Holy One. Isa 12:6; Eze 37:27,28; Zep 3:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-10","title":"Hosea 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>walk. Isa 2:5; 49:10; Jer 2:2; 7:6,9; 31:9; Mic 4:5; Zec 10:12; Joh 8:12 Ro 8:1; 2Pe 2:10 he shall roar like. Isa 31:4; 42:13; Jer 25:30; Joe 3:16; Am 1:2; 3:4,8 shall tremble. Job 37:1; Ps 2:11; 119:120; Isa 64:2; Jer 5:22; 33:9; Hab 3:16 Ac 24:25 west. Zec 8:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-11","title":"Hosea 11:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>out. 3:5; 9:3-6; Isa 11:11; Zec 10:10 as a dove. 7:11; Isa 60:8 and I. Jer 31:12; Eze 28:25; 36:33,34; 37:21,25; Am 9:14,15; Ob 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-11-12","title":"Hosea 11:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>compasseth. 7:16; 12:1,7; Ps 78:36; Isa 29:13; 44:20; 59:3,4; Mic 6:12 Judah. 4:15; 2Ki 18:4-7; 2Ch 29:1-32:33 ruleth. Ge 32:28; 1Co 6:2; Re 1:6; 3:21; 5:10 saints. or, most holy.</p>"}]}